---
interface Props {
  modules: ReadonlyArray<readonly [string, string, string]>
}

const { modules } = Astro.props
---

<section class="digital-modules" aria-labelledby="modules-heading">
  <div class="digital-shell">
    <header class="digital-section-heading">
      <p class="digital-kicker">SYSTEM MODULES</p>
      <h2 id="modules-heading">一条履约链路，<br />不是一组分散的系统。</h2>
      <p>围绕订单从进入仓库到完成交付的过程配置能力，重点是减少状态断点，而不是堆砌工具。</p>
    </header>
    <div class="digital-module-grid">
      {
        modules.map(([number, title, note], index) => (
          <article class:list={['digital-module', { 'digital-module--featured': index === 0 }]}>
            <>
              <span>{number}</span>
              <h3>{title}</h3>
              <p>{note}</p>
            </>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
